  "$description": "The Mosaic design tokens: every literal value the interface is built from, as data. This is the SKIN half of the SDUI contract — the definitions say what a screen is made of, these say what it looks like. The Platform serves them to every client alongside the component library, so a re-skin reaches a running client without a client release. Values that DERIVE from these (a colour mixed from the accent, a gradient composed of two tokens, the acrylic material's layers) are not tokens: they are formulas each client evaluates over the set it was given.",
